{"id":"nd5f8a6f33b","headline":"Trump Says Deal With Iran To Open Hormuz Could Be Soon","summary":"President Trump said negotiations with Iran to reopen the Strait of Hormuz are ongoing and a deal could come soon, though it is not finalised. Iran denies direct talks.","why":"The Strait of Hormuz carries a large share of seaborne oil exports from the Gulf, so disruptions there feed directly into global crude prices and shipping costs.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Strait of Hormuz","country":"Iran","lat":26.57,"lon":56.25,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":["na417e63045"],"source":{"name":"NewsRadio 560 WHYN","url":"https://whyn.iheart.com/content/2026-08-07-trump-says-deal-with-iran-to-open-hormuz-could-be-soon/"},"sources":[{"name":"NewsRadio 560 WHYN","url":"https://whyn.iheart.com/content/2026-08-07-trump-says-deal-with-iran-to-open-hormuz-could-be-soon/"}],"published_at":"2026-08-07T08:41:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"0c7ce817b8790968","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Trump's comments on possible talks to reopen the Strait of Hormuz point to a potential easing of supply risk, while Iran denies direct talks and no deal is finalised.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-07T08:41:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-07T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IR","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-tanker-ship-5227404.jpg","alt":"oil tanker ship (illustration)","credit":"papazachariasa","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/ship-oil-sea-ocean-sky-water-5227404/"}}